Structured bindings: a hidden variable per declaration (they shared one),
prvalue sources materialised so auto&&/const auto& and the tuple-like
lowering do not read a destroyed temporary, and tuple-like bindings are
references to get<i>(e) ([dcl.struct.bind]/4).  Covers libstdc++ 13
std::map::emplace(k, v) (`auto&& [__a, __v] = pair<_Args&...>(__args...)`).
